==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*4 [[LeMurr]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] is necessary to win quickly. [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Dark units]] such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl/Pizza Cat]] can demolish the Gory Darks. [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien units]] are highly recommended.

